{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Echoes of Undeath",
    "steam_appid": 3770720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770720/extras/6a20771c0372742319c2e99ed9a9b2c9.avif?t=1754392799\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><strong>Last Monster Slayers in a world drowning in darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Echoes of Undeath</i> is a gothic, third-person survival action game inspired by classics like Dark Souls, Castlevania, and Vampire Survivors \u2014  survive endless waves of demons and undead, master brutal souls-like combat, and unlock forbidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack and slash hordes of skeletons, demons, and eldritch horrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield swords, axes, and devastating magical sigils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to gain new spells and passive powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless onslaught \u2014 how long can you survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric dark fantasy world with rich VFX and haunting music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned online co-op mode: slay together with friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Early Access Roadmap:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons, maps, and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More spells and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full co-op mode and community-driven features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face your nightmares. How long will you last before you join the legion of the undead?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770720/extras/6a20771c0372742319c2e99ed9a9b2c9.avif?t=1754392799\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><strong>Last Monster Slayers in a world drowning in darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Echoes of Undeath</i> is a gothic, third-person survival action game inspired by classics like Dark Souls, Castlevania, and Vampire Survivors \u2014  survive endless waves of demons and undead, master brutal souls-like combat, and unlock forbidden powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack and slash hordes of skeletons, demons, and eldritch horrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield swords, axes, and devastating magical sigils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to gain new spells and passive powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a relentless onslaught \u2014 how long can you survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric dark fantasy world with rich VFX and haunting music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned online co-op mode: slay together with friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Early Access Roadmap:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons, maps, and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More spells and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full co-op mode and community-driven features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face your nightmares. How long will you last before you join the legion of the undead?</p>",
